            <title>[LU-19616] Project quotas inheritance flag no longer set after migration</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19616</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;tar is not able to keep project inheritance flag and it won&apos;t work for file backup/restart.&lt;br/&gt;
